                                      ↓
                            Scoring (S) ← Weights w
                                ↓
                            Final Rank Order
```

Backdoor paths (confounding):
- U → F → T → M → S
- U → H → E → P → M → S
- H → E → P and H → Thunder (via implicit user behavior patterns)

Sufficient adjustment set for causal effect of candidate attribute X on S:
**{F, H, source (Thunder vs. Phoenix)}**

