### B.5.1 Generative Model

**User Generation**:
```python
# Latent interest distribution per user
user_interests = Dirichlet(α=[1, 1, 1, ...])  # K_topics topics
user_activity_level = Gamma(shape=2, scale=3)  # Engagement intensity

# User-topic affinity
affinity_matrix = user_interests @ topic_embedding_matrix
```

**Post Generation**:
```python
# For each post:
post_topic = Categorical(user_interests)
post_content_length = LogNormal(μ=5, σ=1)
post_has_image = Bernoulli(p=0.4)
post_has_video = Bernoulli(p=0.15)
post_engagement = Poisson(λ=user_activity × topic_popularity × recency_decay)
```

**Engagement Generation**:
```python
# For each user-post pair:
p_like = sigmoid(user_affinity[topic] + content_quality - recency_discount)
p_reply = p_like * 0.1  # Replies are rarer
p_repost = p_like * 0.05
# ... other actions similarly modeled
```

