### B.6.2 Model Hash for Reproducibility

```python
import hashlib
import torch

def compute_model_hash(model: torch.nn.Module, algorithm: str = "sha256") -> str:
    """
    Compute deterministic hash of model weights.
    Useful for tracking mini-model versions.
    """
    hasher = hashlib.new(algorithm)
    
    for param in model.parameters():
        param_bytes = param.data.cpu().numpy().tobytes()
        hasher.update(param_bytes)
    
    return hasher.hexdigest()

